enshot-2560x1440-B.png", "id": "518199367649623", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39035315_518199370982956_3030587656090885372_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=j75ldcalmRIQ7kNvwE-BbNE&_nc_oc=AdmMIVuek8khV5ysTwzB68uMzP0Ad3ZwH5XeqLBBEENzL04C14ZRI73p8ER82DPWgqI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfxuN-G757h2oQHhTRODKhUAX5qGtzb-Ln8vOBjmT_I63A&oe=69BD4C0D"}, {"file_name": "SA-LS-Launch-Meta-Screenshot-2560x1440-C.png", "id": "905966224922640", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974900_905966228255973_5130841505886610815_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=hSsncwBGvPsQ7kNvwGZDyIX&_nc_oc=AdkiQOxhK-J0Ndup1AN29h6lbi38ch4r6hs8EqWhq1J0bFe-YEE1qraqgbJ4GAs85mk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfygdMralUndPNmrBIBOwwsUToyDljcv1uBN6gAStAYx_Q&oe=69BD52CB"}, {"file_name": "SA-LS-Launch-Meta-Screenshot-2560x1440-G.png", "id": "523141100328151", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031339_523141106994817_8586809118821300384_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=dbUslAZJ3KsQ7kNvwFTVwlB&_nc_oc=AdkbOl9IwlxvvvQDsWVvzCmLAY9Zkq8sIhvB7-sCcoOyklUlj8kmFQt5Ca75oBzCwIY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afyi8IvhbkCk2pPyu6VJ3zAlr78ao4wOJFxoUtja_dcHBA&oe=69BD3375"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "SA-LS-Meta-VideoCover-2560x1440.png", "id": "8770630689667401", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982555_8770630713000732_6259191283680804636_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_aid=0&_nc_ohc=mD9pt6HDwdcQ7kNvwHzYFgn&_nc_oc=AdlGrTbEcA8S3QmpRM0ydsaLxAiC_QZoKOXSKdWW6Gdxo1jd3XWEfRXQEW_tCy3Yjts&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfxTwujgIy4nCbiPlZFcgSA_qrrNiuDt1tSJV9eLGWxx-g&oe=69BD4528"}, "display_name": "Last Stand", "keywords": ["pvp", "shoot", "horror", "action", "duel"], "long_description": "Step into the future of mixed reality with Last Stand, from the makers of Drop Dead: The Cabin. This is the world\u2019s first multi-location mixed reality PvP shootout. Your living room becomes a battlefield as you eliminate your opponent while fending off a relentless zombie invasion. Move, dodge, and take cover in a fully immersive combat zone.\n\n{1067517198339345}\n\n**1v1 Mixed Reality PvP Combat**\n\nBattle opponents from anywhere\u2014each player fights from their own home. Turn your living room into a battlefield, outsmarting rivals with real-world strategy.\n\n{1232934048025689}\n\n**Precision Full-Body Tracking**\n\nDodge bullets like in The Matrix or land headshots like John Wick! Our full-body tracking ensures every movement feels accurate and responsive, immersing you deeply in the action.\n\n{428700763582659}\n\n**Your Room, Your Advantage**\n\nTransform your living room from a Netflix haven into a tactical stronghold. Your couch becomes a fortress; your table, a shield. Outsmart and outmaneuver\u2014your home is part of the fight!\n\n{1127967098666563}\n\n**Cinematic Shootouts at Home**\n\nExperience intense gunfights and explosive combat, with dynamic destruction shaping every encounter. With dynamic destruction, every round is as intense as a blockbuster.\n\n**Last Stand is an early access title pushing the boundaries of mixed reality. Join our community on Discord to share feedback and help us shape the future of the game.**\n\nVisit **LastStandXR.com** to learn more and join the discord.", "short_description": "Step into the future of mixed reality with Last Stand, from the makers of Drop Dead: The Cabin. This is the world\u2019s first multi-location mixed reality PvP shootout. Your living room becomes a battlefield as you eliminate your opponent while fending off a relentless zombie invasion. Move, dodge, and take cover in a fully interactive, immersive combat zone."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://soulassembly.com/privacy-policy"